{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國電動車初創企業Slate Auto本周四在其在線商店上架了一款令人意想不到的產品，一本Rand McNally 2027版道路地圖冊，售價30美元（快科技註：折合人民幣約200元），限量發售。官方將其稱為「原始導航系統」，也叫「無屏GPS」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586404.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:43:43.848839+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T10:22:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:36:56.002824+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:36:56.002824+00:00","content_hash":"ce3bb60879b295bd18987ffff886e89dfd4befb84f58191f7e5cc18c3f9b8bc7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}